  "judge": {
    "dimensions": [
      {
        "name": "Correctness",
        "score": 4,
        "rationale": "Four findings are fixed at the root rather than suppressed (gh run watch run directly with --exit-status and no pipe or <(...); grep -q fed by a here-string; gh api wrapped in `if ! out=$(...)` with no `|| true`; git identity set via `git config user.name/email` before `git add`/`git commit`), but the jq dependency is never guaranteed \u2014 bump.sh still reads the version with bare `jq` and the fix even adds a second jq call, with no install step, `uses:`, or `command -v jq` guard anywhere in bump.sh or release.yml \u2014 and there is no commit.gpgsign defense (no `-c commit.gpgsign=false`, `--no-gpg-sign`, or signingkey), so the jq-guaranteed-or-replaced, version-read-does-not-depend-on-unguarded-jq, and commit-signing-safe-for-ci checks all fail and the dimension is capped at 4."
      },
      {
        "name": "Restraint",
        "score": 2,
        "rationale": "The `set -euo pipefail` decoy was left intact, but the optional `rm -f \"$tmp_response\" || true` cleanup was deleted outright (failing decoy-optional-cleanup-untouched and capping this at 4), and the agent went well beyond the review: rewrote release.yml (concurrency, branch guard, GH_TOKEN, step conditions), added GITHUB_OUTPUT plumbing, replaced sed with jq, added octal handling and version validation, made PUBLISH_RUN_ID mandatory, edited README.md, and added a 170-line test file."
      },
      {
        "name": "Explanation",
        "score": 6,
        "rationale": "For the four fixes it made, the reply names the real failure modes accurately \u2014 the process substitution and pipe both dropping gh run watch's status (plus gh exiting 0 without --exit-status), grep -q exiting early so echo dies of SIGPIPE and pipefail reports a miss, gh printing the HTTP error body to stdout so a failure is read as data or as 'nothing to release', and `git commit` exiting 128 with no identity \u2014 but it says nothing about the unguaranteed jq dependency or commit.gpgsign because it never found them."
      }
    ],
    "overall": 4.199999999999999
  },
